  "title": "KPZ limit theorems Jinho Baik\u2217",
  "authors_raw": "July 21, 2022",
  "title_lines": [
   "KPZ limit theorems",
   "Jinho Baik\u2217"
  ],
  "abstract": "One-dimensional interacting particle systems, 1+1 random growth models, and two-dimensional di- rected polymers de\ufb01ne 2d height \ufb01elds. The KPZ universality conjecture posits that an appropriately scaled height function converges to a model-independent universal random \ufb01eld for a large class of mod- els. We survey limit theorems for a few models and discuss changes that arise in di\ufb00erent domains. In particular, we present recent results on periodic domains. We also comment on integrable probability models, integrable di\ufb00erential equations, and universality.",
  "docinfo": {
